SUMMARY:Sunday Park\, Trail and Neighbourhood Walk! (with Patio Dinner Par
 ty after)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 **\\*\\*Kindly Read Carefully\\*\\***\n\nPlease join me and my other group
 s for a fun Sunday social leisure nature walk that will include trails\, p
 arks and cool neighbourhoods in the Yonge and Eglinton area. The day will 
 continue after the walk with a patio party with pizza and burger specials 
 for the group!\n\n**Time and Location: Where to meet us?**\nWe will meet a
 t out front of the **Burger Priest (2 Eglinton Avenue)**\n\\*Arrive early 
